<A NAME="_patalam_00"><P><B>((_antac ciṟappu.))</B></A>
<P>{{U 00}}

<P>taṭamār tarupoḻiṟ poṉpaṟṟi kāvalaṉ ṟāṉmoḻinta
<BR>paṭivīra cōḻiyak kāriki nūṟṟeṇ paḵtoṭoṉṟiṉ
<BR>tiṭamār poḻippuri yipperun tēvaṉ cekampaḻiccak
<BR>kaṭaṉāka vēnaviṉ ṟāṉṟamiḻ kātaliṟ kaṟpavarkkē.

<P><i>((nērici veṇpā.))</i>

<P>_ōrā teḻutiṉē ṉōruriyi yoṇporuḷi
<BR>yārāyntu koḷva taṟivuṭimi-cīrāyntu
<BR>kuṟṟaṅ kaḷintu kuṟipeytu vācittal
<BR>kaṟṟaṟinta māntar kaṭaṉ.

<HR>


<HR>
<P><B>((_ōm))</B>
<A NAME="_patalam_0"><H1>((vīracōḻiyam))</H1></A>
<H1>((pāyiram))</H1>
<P>{{U 0}}
<P><i>((kaṭṭaḷik kalittuṟi))</i>

<A NAME="_Vi_0a"><P>1.</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_0a">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<P>mikkavaṉ, pōtiyiṉ mētak
<BR>kiruntavaṉ, meyttavattāl
<BR>tokkavaṉ, yārkkun toṭaravoṇ
<BR>ṇātavaṉ, tūyaṉeṉat
<BR>takkavaṉ pātan talimēṟ
<BR>puṉintu tamiḻurikkap
<BR>pukkavaṉ pimpoḻiṟ poṉpaṟṟi
<BR>maṉputta mittiraṉē.

<A NAME="_Vi_0b"><P>2.</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_0b">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<P>_āyuṅ kuṇattava lōkitaṉ
<BR>pakka lakattiyaṉkēṭ
<BR>ṭēyum puvaṉik kiyampiya
<BR>taṇṭami ḻīṅkurikka
<BR>nīyu muḷiyō veṉiṟkaru
<BR>ṭaṉceṉṟa nīḷvicumpil
<BR>_īyum paṟakku mitaṟkeṉ
<BR>kolōcollu mēntiḻiyē.

<A NAME="_Vi_0c"><P>3.</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_0c">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<P>nāmē veḻuttucco ṉaṟporuḷ
<BR>yāppalaṅ kārameṉum
<BR>pāmēvu pañca vatikāra
<BR>māmparap piccurukkit
<BR>tēmē viyatoṅkaṟ ṟērvīra
<BR>cōḻaṉ ṟiruppeyarāṟ
<BR>pūmē lurippaṉ vaṭanūṉ
<BR>marapum pukaṉṟu koṇṭē.


<HR>
<H1>((mutalāvatu _eḻuttatikāram))</H1>
<A NAME="_patalam_1"><H2>((cantippaṭalam))</H2></A>
<P>{{U 1}}

<P><i>((kaṭṭaḷik kalittuṟi))</i>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_1">Vi_1</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_1">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_uyireḻuttu, _āytaveḻuttu, meyyeḻuttu, mūviṉamey))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<BR>_aṟinta veḻuttammuṉ paṉṉiraṇṭāvikaḷāṉa; kammuṉ
<BR>piṟanta patiṉeṭṭu mey; naṭu vāytam; peyarttiṭiyā
<BR>muṟintaṉa yammuta lāṟum; ṅañaṇa namaṉaveṉṟu
<BR>ceṟintaṉa melliṉam; ceppāta valliṉam; tēmoḻiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P>(_itaṉ poruḷ)
<DL>
<DT>_aṟinta _eḻuttu _ammuṉ paṉṉiraṇṭu _āvikaḷāṉa 
<DD>- _aṟintu collappaṭāniṉṟaveḻuttukkaḷukkuḷḷē _akaramutal _aukāramīṟākac collappaṭṭa paṉṉiraṇṭeḻuttum _uyireḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>kammuṉ piṟanta patiṉeṭṭu mey 
<DD>- kakaravoṟṟu mutal ṉakaravoṟṟīṟākac collappaṭṭapatiṉeṭṭeḻuttum meyyeḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>naṭu _āytam 
<DD>- _uyireḻuttiṟkum meyyeḻuttiṟkum naṭuvān taṉmiyāyirukkiṟa _aḵkēṉam _eṉṉun taṉinili _eḻuttāṉatu _āytaveḻutteṉṉum peyaratām; 
<DT>peyarttu _iṭiyā muṟintaṉa ya mutal _āṟum 
<DD>- muṉ coṉṉa patiṉeṭṭu meykaḷukkuḷḷum ya ra la va ḻa ḷa veṉṉum _āṟeḻuttum _iṭiyiṉaveḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>ṅa ña ṇa na ma ṉa _eṉṟu ceṟintaṉa melliṉam 
<DD>- ṅa ña ṇa na ma ṉaveṉṉum _āṟeḻuttum melliṉaveḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>ceppāta valliṉam 
<DD>- _ivaṟṟuṭ collātoḻinta ka ca ṭa ta pa ṟa veṉṉum _āṟeḻuttum valliṉaveḻutteṉṉum peyaravām (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>`tēmoḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_2">Vi_2</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_2">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((kuṟil, neṭil, _uyiraḷapeṭi, varkkaveḻuttu, kuṟṟiyalukaram))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_iṟutimey nīṅkiya vīrāṟi lintu kuṟil; neṭil_ēḻ
<BR>peṟuvari yāṉ; neṭunīrmi yaḷapu; piṇintavarkkam
<BR>maṟuvaṟu valloṟṟu melloṟṟu mām; vaṉmi mēlukaram
<BR>_uṟuvatu niyun toṭarmoḻip piṉṉu neṭiṟpiṉṉumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_iṟutimey nīṅkiya _īrāṟil _aintu kuṟil neṭil _ēḻ peṟuvariyāṉ 
<DD>- varukkaṅkaṭōṟum _iṟutiyeḻuttu nīṅkalāka maṟṟap paṉṉiraṇṭu _eḻuttukkaḷukkuḷḷum _ainteḻuttuk kuṟṟeḻutteṉṉum peyaravām;
_ēḻeḻuttu neṭṭeḻutteṉṉum peyaravām;
<DT> neṭu nīrmi _aḷapu
<DD>-_uyiraḷapeṭiyāṉatu neṭu nīrmiyuṭittu;
<DT> piṇinta varkkam maṟu _aṟu valloṟṟum melloṟṟum _ām 
<DD>- valloṟṟum melloṟṟum _iṇintu varuvatu varkkaveḻutteṉṉum peyaratām;
<DT> vaṉmimēl _ukaram _uṟuvatu niyum toṭar moḻi piṉṉum neṭil piṉṉumē 
<DD>- taṉi neṭiṟpiṉṉum pala _eḻuttukkaḷ toṭarumoḻikkaṇṇum _īṟṟilē ka ca ṭa ta pa ṟa _eṉṉum _āṟu valleḻuttiṉiyum _ūrntu _ukaram vantāl _anta _ukaramāṉatu kuṟukik kuṟṟiyalukaram _eṉṉum peyaratām (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_3">Vi_3</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_3">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_eḻuttup pōli, _iṟuti viṉā, ..))
<BR>((.. puḷḷi peṟum _eḻuttukkaḷ, cuṭṭu, kuṟṟiyalikaram))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_akaram vakaratti ṉōṭiyin tuvām; yakarattiṉō
<BR>ṭakara miyintiya tākum; _ā _ē _ō viṉāvantamām;
<BR>_ekara _okaramey yiṟpuḷḷi mēvum; _a _i _uccuṭṭām;
<BR>_ikaraṅ kuṟuki varuṅkuṟ ṟukarampiṉ yavvariṉē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_akaram vakarattiṉōṭu _iyintu _auvām
<DD>- _akaramāṉatu vakarattōṭuṅkūṭi _aukāramām; 
<DT>yakarattiṉōṭu _akaramiyintu _aiyatākum 
<DD>- piṉṉum _akaramāṉatu yakarattōṭuṅ kūṭi _aikāramām; 
<DT>_ā _ē _ō viṉā _antamām 
<DD>- _ā _ē _ō _eṉṉum mūṉṟeḻuttum moḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟilē niṉṟu viṉāveḻuttu _eṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>_ekaram _okaram meyyil puḷḷi mēvum 
<DD>- _ekara _okaraṅkaḷum, meykaḷ patiṉeṭṭum mēlē puḷḷi peṟṟup puḷḷiyeḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>_a _i _u cuṭṭām 
<DD>- _a _i _u _eṉṉum mūṉṟeḻuttum moḻikku mutalilē cuṭṭeḻutteṉṉum peyaravām; 
<DT>_ikaram kuṟuki varum kuṟṟukaram piṉ yavvariṉē 
<DD>- kuṟṟiyalukarattiṉ piṉṉar yakaram vantu puṇarntāl _ikaramām; 
_anta _ikaramāṉatu kuṟukik kuṟṟiyalikaram _eṉṉum peyaratām (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_4">Vi_4</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_4">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((coṉmuṉvarum viṉā, ..))
<BR>((.. _eḻuttukkaḷ piṟakkum _olimuyaṟciyiṉ vaki, ..))
<BR>((.. _iṭinili mayakkam))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_ēyā_ec coṉmuṉ viṉā; _eṭut talpaṭut talnalital
<BR>_ōyā turappal _eṉanāl vakiyiṟ piṟakkumeykaḷ
<BR>cāyā mayakkantam muṉṉarp piṟavoṭu tāmumvantu
<BR>vīyāta _īroṟṟu mūvoṟ ṟuṭaṉili vēṇṭuvarē.


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_ē yā _e col muṉ viṉā
<DD> _ekara _ēkāraṅkaḷum yāvum moḻiyiṉatu mutalilē niṉṟu viṉāveḻutteṉṉum peyaravām;
<DT>_eṭuttal paṭuttal nalital _ōyātu _urappal _eṉa nālvakiyil piṟakkum meykaḷ cāyā mayakkam tam muṉṉar piṟavoṭu tāmum vantu vīyāta _īroṟṟu mūvoṟṟu _uṭaṉili vēṇṭuvarē
<DD>_eṭuttum paṭuttum nalintum _urappiyuñ collutalākiya nālvakiyiṉālēyum piṟakkumeḻuttukkaḷāṉavi tam muṉṉart tām vantu mayaṅkiyum tammuṉṉarp piṟaveḻuttukkaḷ vantu mayaṅkiyum _īroṟṟuṭaṉiliyāyum mūvoṟṟuṭaṉiliyāyum varappeṟum _eṉṟu colluvarkaḷ mēlākiya pulavarkaḷ (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_5">Vi_5</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_5">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((māttiriyum, piṉvarum _uyir _oṟṟuṭaṉ kūṭum _eṉpatum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>kuṟṟeḻut toṉ(ṟu); _oṉ ṟariyākumiyu _iraṇṭuneṭil;
<BR>_oṟṟeḻut tāytam_i _u_ari; mūṉṟaḷa(pu); _ōṅkuyirmey
<BR>maṟṟeḻut taṉṟuyir māttiri yēpeṟum; maṉṉukiṉṟa
<BR>_oṟṟeḻut tiṉpiṉ ṉuyirvariṉ _ēṟum _oḷiyiḻiyē!


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>kuṟṟeḻuttu _oṉṟu 
<DD>- kuṟṟeḻuttoru māttiri peṟum; 
<DT>_oṉṟariyākum _ai _au 
<DD>- _aikāra _aukārak kuṟukkaṅkaḷ _oṉṟari māttiri peṟum; 
<DT>_iraṇṭu neṭil 
<DD>- neṭṭeḻuttu _iraṇṭumāttiri peṟum; 
<DT>_oṟṟeḻuttu _āytam _i _u _ari 
<DD>- _oṟṟeḻuttum _āytaveḻuttum kuṟṟiyalikaramum kuṟṟiyalukaramum_ākiya nāṉkum _ovvoṉṟu _ari māttiri peṟum, 
<DT>mūṉṟu _aḷapu
<DD>-_uyiraḷapeṭiyāṉatu mūṉṟu māttiri peṟum; 
<DT>_ōṅku _uyirmey maṟṟu _eḻuttu _aṉṟu _uyirmāttiriyē peṟum 
<DD>- _uyirmeyyeḻuttāṉatu vēṟēyeḻuttaṉṟu, _uyirmāttiriyē peṟum(_ēṟiya _uyiriṉaḷavē _uyirmeykkum _aḷaveṉak koḷka.); 
<DT>maṉṉukiṉṟa _oṟṟeḻuttiṉ piṉ _uyirvariṉ _ēṟum
<DD>-nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟoṟṟiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi _uyir mutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl vanta _uyirāṉatu _oṟṟiṉ mēlēṟi naṭakkum (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>`_oḷiyiḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_6">Vi_6</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_6">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_eḻuttukkaḷ piṟattaṟkuk kāraṇamākiya _iṭamum muyaṟciyum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_unti mutaleḻuṅ kāṟṟup piṟantura muñciramum
<BR>panta malikaṇ ṭamumūkkum _uṟṟaṇṇam palluṭaṉē
<BR>muntu mitaḻnā moḻiyuṟup pāku muyaṟciyiṉāl
<BR>vantu meḻutteṉṟu colluvar vāṇutalē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
nāpik kamalattiṉiṉṟu _eḻāniṉṟa vāyuvāṉatu mārpiṉ _iṭamākavum cirattiṉ _iṭamākavum kaṇṭattiṉ _iṭamākavum mūkkiṉ _iṭamākavum porunti veḷiyē puṟappaṭumpōtu _aṇṇam, pal, _itaḻ, nāveṉṟu collappaṭāniṉṟa _avayavaṅkaḷiṉ muyaṟciyiṉāl vevvēṟeḻuttoliyāyp piṟakkumeṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`vāṇutalē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.

<P>_ivaṟṟuḷ _uratti valliṉamum, ciratti _āytamum, kaṇṭatti _uyirum _iṭiyiṉamum, mūkki melliṉamum poruntumeṉakkoḷka.

<P>muyaṟciyuḷ _ōreḻuttiṟkup pala muyaṟciyuḷavātaliṉ, _eḻutteḻuttāy muyaṟci kūṟiṉ _īṇṭup perukum _eṉa viṭuttaṉam _eṉka.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_7">Vi_7</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_7">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((mutaṉili (moḻikku mutalākum _eḻuttukkaḷ) ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āvi yaṉittuṅ ka ca ta napamav variyumvavvil
<BR>_ēviya _eṭṭumyav vāṟumñan nāṉkum_el lāvulakum
<BR>mēviya veṇkuṭic cempiyaṉ vīrarā cēntiraṉṟaṉ
<BR>nāviyal centamiṭ colliṉ moḻimutal naṉṉutalē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _uyireḻuttup paṉṉiraṇṭum, kakāra cakāra takāra nakāra pakāra makāra varkkaṅkaḷum, vakāra varkkattil _u _ū _o _ō _allāta _eṭṭeḻuttum, yakāra varkkattil _a _ā _u _ū _o _auvākiya _āṟeḻuttum, ñakāra varkkattil _a _ā _e _o _ākiya nāṉkeḻuttum _ākiya _iviyaṉittum _ellā _ulakun taṉ veṇ koṟṟakkuṭi niḻaṟkīḻ _āḷāniṉṟa vīracōḻa makārācāviṉuṭiya nāviṉiṭamākac collappaṭṭa centamiṭcollukku moḻikku mutalākiya _eḻuttukkaḷām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`naṉṉutalē' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_8">Vi_8</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_8">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_iṟutinili (moḻikku _īṟākum _eḻuttukkaḷ) ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_īṟum makara ṇakaraṅka ṭāmum _iṭiyiṉattil
<BR>_ēṟum vakaram _oḻintintum _īrin teḻiluyirum
<BR>vīṟu malivēṅ kaṭaṅkuma rikkiṭi mēviṟaṟeṉṟu
<BR>kūṟun tamiḻiṉuk kīṟṟeḻut tāmeṉpar kōlvaḷiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> patiṉeṭṭāmeyyākiya ṉakaravoṟṟum, makāra ṇakāravoṟṟukkaḷum, _iṭiyiṉaveḻuttil vakara _oṟṟoḻinta maṟṟa _aintoṟṟum, _uyireḻuttukkaḷuḷ _ekara _okara moḻinta maṟṟap patteḻuttum _ākiya _iviyaṉittum kuṇakaṭal kumari kuṭakam vēṅkaṭam _eṉṉum _innāṉku _ellikkuḷḷum vaḻaṅkāniṉṟa centamiṭcollukku moḻikkīṟākiya _eḻuttukkaḷām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`kōlvaḷiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_9">Vi_9</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_9">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_iyalpu puṇarcciyum vikārap puṇarcciyum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>niṉṟacol līṟum varuñcoṉ mutalum niravittammuḷ
<BR>_oṉṟiṭum pōtum _orōmoḻik kaṇṇu mulakiṟkoppi
<BR>ṉaṉṟiya mummi vikāramvan teytiṭuma; naṉkiyalpiṟ
<BR>kuṉṟuta liṉṟi varutalu muṇṭeṉṟu kūṟuvarē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>niṉṟa collīṟum varuñcoṉmutalum niravit tammuḷ _oṉṟiṭum pōtum _orō moḻikkaṇṇum _ulakiṟkoppiṉaṉṟiya mummi vikāram vanteytiṭum 
<DD>- nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟum varumoḻiyiṉatu mutalum _oṉṟōṭoṉṟu kalantu puṇarumiṭattum _orōviṭattut taṉimoḻikkaṇṇum _ulakattukku _oppākat tōṉṟal tirital keṭutal _eṉṉu mūṉṟu vikāram varappeṟum; 
<DT>naṉkiyalpiṟ kuṉṟutaliṉṟi varutalum _uṇṭeṉṟu kūṟuvar 
<DD>- _orōviṭattu vikārappāṭillāmal nilimoḻiyiṉatīṟum varumoḻiyiṉatu mutalum tiriyāmal _iyalpāy muṭitalum _uṇṭeṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_10">Vi_10</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_10">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((vaṭamoḻikkaṇ varum vikārap puṇarcci))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āṉṟā mulōpatto ṭākama mātēca māriyattuḷ
<BR>mūṉṟā moḻiyo ṭeḻuttu vikāram mutaṉaṭuvī
<BR>ṟēṉṟām vakiyoṉpa tākalu muṇ(ṭu); _avi yevviṭattun
<BR>tōṉṟā vulakat tavarkkotta pōtaṉṟit tūmoḻiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_āṉṟām _ulōpattoṭu _ākamam _ātēcam _āriyattuḷ mūṉṟām moḻiyoṭu _eḻuttu vikāram
<DD>- vaṭamoḻikkaṇ _oru colliṉiṭamākavum _ōreḻuttiṉiṭamākavum _ulōpam _eṉṟum _ākamam _eṉṟum _ātēcam _eṉṟum mūṉṟu vikāram varappeṟum; 
<DT>mutal naṭu _īṟu _ēṉṟām vakiyoṉpatu _ākalum _uṇṭu. 
<DD>piṉṉum vikāraṅkaḷāṉavi moḻiyiṉatu mutalilēyum moḻiyiṉatiṭiyilēyum moḻiyiṉatu kaṭiyilēyum _eṉa mummūṉṟāka vikaṟpikka _oṉpatu vikāramām; _eḻuttiṉu moḻiyiṉumākap patiṉeṭṭām.
<DT>_avi yevviṭattum tōṉṟā vulakattavarkkotta pōtaṉṟi 
<DD>- piṉṉum _avvikāraṅkaḷāṉavi _ulakattārkkotta pōtaṉṟi maṟṟevviṭattum varappeṟā _eṉak koḷka (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>`tūmoḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_11">Vi_11</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_11">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((vaṭamoḻiyil _etirmaṟip poruḷil varum nakāramum, ..))
<BR>((.. _ē, _ō _eṉpavaṟṟiṉ tiripum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>coṉṉa moḻipporu ṇīkku nakāram; _ac coṉmuṉmeyyēl
<BR>_annili yāka vuṭalkeṭum; _āvimuṉ ṉākilatu
<BR>taṉṉili māṟṟiṭum; _ē_ō _iraṇṭum taṉimoḻimuṉ
<BR>maṉṉiya _ai_auvu mākum vaṭamoḻi vācakattē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>

<DL>
<DT>coṉṉa moḻip poruḷ nīkkum nakāram
<DD>-vaṭamoḻikkaṇ _oru colliṟkurittākiya poruḷi nīkkutaṟporuṭṭāka _accolliṉ muṉṉar _oru nakāram varappeṟum; 
<DT>_accol muṉ meyyēl _anniliyāka _uṭal keṭum 
<DD>- piṉṉumantac collāṉatu meymmutaṉmoḻiyākil _accolliṉ muṉnakārattiṉ mēṉiṉṟa _uyir niṟka _uṭalkeṭum; 
<DT>_āvi muṉṉākil _atu taṉ nili māṟṟiṭum 
<DD>- piṉṉumantac coṉṉa collāṉatu _uyir mutaṉmoḻiyākil _accolliṉ muṉ niṉṟa nakārattiṉ mēṉiṉṟa _uyir pirintu taṉṉiliyi māṟṟi _uyir muṉṉum _oṟṟup piṉṉumāka niṟkum; 
<DT>_ē_ō _iraṇṭum taṉimoḻi muṉ maṉṉiya _ai_auvum _ākum vaṭamoḻi vācakattē
<DD>- moḻimutaṟkaṇiṉṟa _ēkāra _ōkāraṅkaḷiraṇṭum tamiḻil tamiḻil varumpōtu _aikāra _aukāraṅkaḷākavum varum (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_12">Vi_12</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_12">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((vaṭamoḻic canti))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āvum _akarak kikarattuk kiyum_au vum_ukarak
<BR>kēvum _iruviṉuk kārum virutti; _eḻilukarak
<BR>kōvum _ikarattiṟ kēyuṅ kuṇameṉ ṟurippa; vantu
<BR>tāvum _ivitatti tattiṉun tātup peyariṉumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>

<DL>
<DT>_āvum _akarakku _ikarattukku _aiyum _auvum _ukarakku _ēvum _iruviṉukku _ārum virutti 
<DD>- _akarattiṟku _ākāramum _ikarattiṟku _aikāramum _ukarattiṟku _aukāramum _iruveṉpataṟku _āreṉpatum _ātēcamāy vantu viruttiyeṉappaṭum; 
<DT>_eḻil _ukarakku _ōvum _ikarattiṟku _ēyuṅ kuṇam _eṉṟu _urippa
<DD>- _ukarattiṟku _ōkāramum _ikarattiṟku _ēkāramum _ātēcamāy vantu kuṇameṉappaṭum _eṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar; 
<DT>vantu tāvum _ivi tattitattiṉum tātup peyariṉumē 
<DD>- _inta viruttiyuṅ kuṇamun tattitappeyar muṭikkum _iṭattum tātuppeyar muṭikkum _iṭattum varappeṟum (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_13">Vi_13</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_13">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>(tamiḻc canti)
<BR>((_uyirmuṉ _uyir varutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. cila nilimoḻikaḷiṉ _īṟaḻitalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>mūṉṟoṭu nāṉkoṉpa tāmuyirp piṉṉuyir muntiṉaṭu
<BR>_āṉṟa yakāramvan tākama mākum; _al lāvuyiruk
<BR>kēṉṟa vakāram; _eṭ ṭēṟkum _iraṇṭum; _iṟutikeṭṭut
<BR>tōṉṟu niliyum _orōviṭat tāmeṉpar tūmoḻiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>mūṉṟoṭu nāṉku _oṉpatu _ām _uyirpiṉ _uyir muntiṉ naṭu _āṉṟayakāram vantu _ākamamākum 
<DD>- _ikara _īkāra _aikāra _uyirīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar,varumoḻi _uyirmutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyēyakāravoṟṟu vantu _ākamamām; 
<DT>_allā _uyirukku _ēṉṟa vakāram 
<DD>- _iviyallāta maṟṟa _uyirīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉarvarumoḻi _uyir mutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl _iṭiyēvakaravoṟṟu vantu _ākamamām; 
<DT>_eṭṭu _ēṟkum _iraṇṭum 
<DD>- _ēkāravīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi _uyirmutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl yakāra vakāravoṟṟukkaḷ _iraṇṭumvantu _ākamamām; 
<DT>_iṟuti keṭṭu tōṉṟum niliyum _orōviṭattu _ām _eṉpar 
<DD>- _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟiṉ niṉṟa patamātal, _uyirmeyyātal, _uyirātal, _oṟṟātal _aḻintu canti kāriyam paṇṇappaṭum _eṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>`tūmoḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_14">Vi_14</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_14">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((ṇakara meyyiṉaṉ muṉ takaranakaram puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. kuṟṟoṟṟiṉ piṉ _uyir puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. ya ra ḻa _oṟṟiṉaṉ muṉ valliṉam puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āṟā muṭaliṉpiṉ tavvariṉ _āṅkatin tāmuṭalām;
<BR>kūṟārnta navvariṉ muṉpiṉa tām; kuṟiṟ piṉpumeykaḷ
<BR>_ēṟā vuyirpiṉ varaviraṇ ṭākum; yav vōṭuraḻa
<BR>_īṟā varilvaṉmi piṉpilvark kattoṟ ṟiṭippaṭumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_āṟām _uṭaliṉ piṉ ta variṉ _āṅkatu _aintām _uṭalām 
<DD>- ṇakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutaltakāram vantu puṇarntāl vanta takāramāṉatu ṭakāramām; 
<DT>kūṟārnta navariṉ muṉpiṉatām
<DD>-ṇakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutalnakāram vantu puṇarntāl vanta nakāramum ṇakāramām; 
<DT>kuṟil piṉpu meykaḷ _ēṟā _uyir piṉ vara _iraṇṭākum 
<DD>- kuṟṟeḻuttiṉ piṉṉiṉṟa _oṟṟukkaḷāṉavi varumoḻi _uyir mutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē _avvoṟṟu _iraṭṭittu niṟkum; 
<DT>yavvōṭu raḻa _īṟā varil vaṉmi piṉpil varkkattu _oṟṟu _iṭippaṭumē 
<DD>- yakāra rakāra ḻakāra _oṟṟu _īṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē _avvavvanta valloṟṟum valliṉa varukkamelloṟṟum mikku muṭiyum (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_15">Vi_15</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_15">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_i, _ī, _ai _eṉpavaṟṟuṭaṉ nakaram puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. ḻakara ḷakara meykaḷuṭaṉ takaram puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>nāṉkoṭu mūṉṟoṉpa tāmuyi riṉpiṉpu navvarumēl
<BR>_ēṉṟa ñakārama tākum; patiṉinto(ṭu) _eṇṇiraṇṭāyt
<BR>tōṉṟuṭaṟ piṉṉart takāram variṉiraṇ ṭuntoṭarpāl
<BR>_āṉṟavin tāmuṭal _ām; muṉpi loṟṟuk kaḻivumuṇṭē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>nāṉkoṭu mūṉṟu _oṉpatām _uyiriṉ piṉpu navarumēl _eṉṟa ñakāramatākum 
<DD>- _ikara _īkāra _aikāra _uyirīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal nakāram vantu puṇarntāl, vanta nakāramāṉatu ñakāramām; 
<DT>patiṉintoṭu _eṇṇiraṇṭāy tōṉṟu _uṭal piṉṉar takāram variṉ _iraṇṭum toṭarpāl _āṉṟa _aintām _uṭalām 
<DD>- ḻakāra ḷakāra _oṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal takāram vantu puṇarntāl, nilimoḻiyīṟum varumoḻi mutalum tirintu taṉittaṉi _iraṇṭum ṭakāramām; 
<DT>muṉpil _oṟṟukku _aḻivumuṇṭē 
<DD>- piṉṉum _avvilakkaṇattuḷ nilimoḻi _īṟṟiṟku _aḻivumuṇṭu (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_16">Vi_16</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_16">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((ḷakaramey valliṉattōṭum nakara makaraṅkaḷōṭum puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. taṉi neṭiṟpiṉ varum ḷakaramey takarattōṭu puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_eṇṇiraṇ ṭāmoṟṟu vaṉmivan tāṟpiṉ piyintavintā
<BR>naṇṇiya voṟṟām; nakaram variṉmuṉmeyṇavvatuvām;
<BR>taṇṇiya mavvan tiṭiṉumaḵtē; taṉineṭiṟpiṉ
<BR>paṇṇiya voṟṟuppiṉ ṟāṉvarap pōmoru kāṟpayiṉṟē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>
<DL>
<DT>_eṇṇiraṇṭām _oṟṟu vaṉmi vantāl piṉpu _iyinta _aintā naṇṇiya _oṟṟām 
<DD>- ḷakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ḷakāramāṉatu ṭakāramām; 
<DT>nakaram variṉ muṉ mey ṇavvatuvām 
<DD>- ḷakara voṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutalnakāram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ḷakāramāṉatu ṇakāramām; taṇṇiya mavantiṭiṉum _aḵtē. ḷakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal makāram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ḷakāramāṉatu ṇakāramām; 
<DT>taṉi neṭil piṉ paṇṇiya _oṟṟup piṉ tāṉ varappōm _orukāl payiṉṟē 
<DD>- taṉi neṭiṟkīḻ niṉṟa ḷakaravoṟṟiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal takāram vantu puṇarntāl, _ātēcamāṉa ṭakāraṅkaḷuḷ taṉineṭiṟkīḻ vanta ṭakāram keṭum (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_17">Vi_17</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_17">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((lakaramey nakarattōṭum yakarattōṭum ..))
<BR>((.. valliṉattōṭum puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. yakaramey nakarattōṭu puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>paṉmūṉṟa tāmuṭal nappiṉ varumeṉi ṉīṟṟeḻuttām;
<BR>paṉṉēḻa tāmvaṉmi piṉvariṉ; _āyiṭit tavvumaḵtām;
<BR>piṉṉā mikāra matupaṉṉoṉ ṟāmuṭal piṉvarumēl;
<BR>coṉṉā riyaviṉpiṉ ṟōṉṟu nakāra ñakārameṉṟē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B>

<DL>
<DT>paṉmūṉṟatām _uṭal na piṉ varumeṉiṉ _īṟṟeḻuttām 
<DD>- lakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutalnakāram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta lakāramāṉatu ṉakāramām; 
<DT>paṉṉēḻatām vaṉmi piṉvariṉ 
<DD>- varumoḻimutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl _anta lakāramāṉatuṟakāramām; 
<DT>_āyiṭi tavvumaḵtām 
<DD>- puṇarnta valliṉam takāramāyiṉ vanta takāramum ṟakāramēyām; 
<DT>piṉṉām _ikāramatu paṉṉoṉṟām _uṭal piṉ varumēl 
<DD>- lakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal yakāram vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē _ōr _ikaram varappeṟum; 
<DT>coṉṉār _iyaviṉ piṉ tōṉṟum nakāram ñakārameṉaṉṟē 
<DD>- yakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal nakāram vantu puṇarntāl, vanta nakāramāṉatu ñakāramām _eṉṟu colluvar pulavar (_e-ṟu.)
</DL>


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_18">Vi_18</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_18">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((ḻakaramey valliṉattōṭum nakarattōṭum ..))
<BR>((.. makarattōṭum puṇartalum, _iyalpu cantiyum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_aimmūṉṟa tāmuṭal vaṉmipiṉ vantiṭil _āṟoṭintām
<BR>meymmāṇpa tām; nav variṉmuṉ ṉaḻintupiṉ mikkaṇavvām;
<BR>mammēl variṉiru mūṉṟā muṭal; maṟ ṟiyalpucanti
<BR>tammā cakalaṅ kiṭappiṉka ḷāmeṉpa tāḻkuḻalē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _aimmūṉṟatām _uṭal vaṉmi piṉ vantiṭil _āṟoṭu _aintām mey māṇpatām - ḻakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻippatattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ḻakāramāṉatu ṇakāramum ṭakāramumām; navariṉ muṉṉaḻintu piṉ mikka ṇavvām - varumoḻi mutal nakāram vantu puṇar/ntāl, _anta ḻakāramāṉatu keṭṭu vanta nakāram ṇakāramām; mamēl variṉ _iru mūṉṟām _uṭal - varumoḻimutal makāram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ḻakāramāṉatu ṇakāramām; maṟṟiyalpu canti tam mācakalaṅkiṭappiṉkaḷām _eṉpa - _iyalpu cantiyāvaṉa tattaṅkiṭappilē kiṭakkum _eṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`tāḻkuḻalē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_19">Vi_19</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_19">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((makaramey valliṉa melliṉaṅkaḷōṭu puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. _atu vakaram varak kuṟukutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. vakaramey takarattōṭu puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>vaṉmivan tāṟpiṉpu pattā muṭalvaṉmi yiṉvarukkat
<BR>taṉmiyoṟ ṟākum; ñanamakkaḷ piṉvariṟ cāṟṟumappōm;
<BR>muṉvayiṟ kālvav variṉ; patiṉ mūṉṟā muṭalaḻiyum
<BR>piṉaṉvayiṉaṉ tavvariṉ tavvuṅ kaṭivaṉmip pēṟuṟumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> vaṉmi vantāl piṉpu pattām _uṭal vaṉmiyiṉ varukkat taṉmiyoṟṟākum - makaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻimutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _anta makaramāṉatu _avvavvanta valloṟṟum valliṉa varkka _oṟṟumām; ña na makkaḷ piṉ varil cāṟṟu ma pōm - varumoḻi mutal ña na makkaḷ vantu puṇarntāl, _anta makāramāṉatu keṭum; muṉ vayiṉ kāl va variṉ - varumoḻi mutal vakaram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta makaramāṉatu kuṟukik kāl māttiriyāy _uṭpuḷḷi peṟum; patiṉmūṉṟām _uṭal _aḻiyum piṉ vayiṉ ta variṉ tavvum kaṭivaṉmi pēṟuṟumē - lakāra _oṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal takāram vantu puṇarntāl, _anta lakāramāṉatu keṭṭu vanta takāramum ṟakāramākap peṟum (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_20">Vi_20</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_20">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((ṉakaramey nakarattōṭum takarattōṭum puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. _uyir valliṉattōṭu puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_īṟṟiṉpiṉ navvari ṉīṟṟeḻut tām; _eḻil tavvariltav
<BR>vēṟṟup patiṉēḻa tāmuṭa lām; _eytum _āviyiṉpiṉ
<BR>_āṟṟun tiṟalval liṉamvan tiṭilavaṟ ṟiṉvarukkam
<BR>pōṟṟu miviyeṉṟa valloṟṟu melloṟṟum pukkiṭumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _īṟṟiṉ piṉ na variṉ _īṟṟeḻuttām - ṉakara _oṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal nakāram vantu puṇarntāl, vanta nakāramum _appatiṉeṭṭām _uṭalākiya ṉakāramām; _eḻil ta varil ta vēṟṟup patiṉēḻatām _uṭalām - varumoḻi mutal takāram vantu puṇarntāl, vanta takāramāṉatu ṟakāramām; _eytum _āviyiṉ piṉ _āṟṟum tiṟal valliṉam vantiṭil _avaṟṟiṉ varukkam pōṟṟum _iviyeṉṟa valloṟṟum melloṟṟum pukkiṭumē - _uyirīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē _avvavvanta valloṟṟum valliṉa varukkavoṟṟum mikku muṭiyum (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_21">Vi_21</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_21">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((kuṟṟiyalukaram _uyirvarak keṭutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. kuṟṟiyalukarattiṉ _ayal melloṟṟu valloṟṟātalum, ..))
<BR>((.. _avaṟṟiṉ muṉ valloṟṟu mikutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. cila muṟṟiyalukaraṅkaḷum _uyirvarak keṭutalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āvipiṉ ṟōṉṟak keṭuṅkuṟ ṟukaram; _avaṟṟiṉmelloṟ
<BR>ṟēviya vāṟeḻil valloṟṟu mām; _iṉi vaṉmiyoṟṟu
<BR>mēvi yataṉmuṉ viḷitalum vēṇṭuvar; _āvivantāṟ
<BR>pāviya muṟṟuka rattiṉ citivum pakarntaṉarē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _āvi piṉ tōṉṟak keṭum kuṟṟukaram - nilimoḻiyīṟṟuk kuṟṟiyalukarattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi _uyirmutalākiya moḻivantu puṇarntāl, _annilimoḻiyīṟṟuk kuṟṟiyalukaramāṉatu taṉakku _ātāramākiya meyyiviṭṭut tāṉ keṭum; _avaṟṟiṉ melloṟṟu _ēviyavāṟu _eḻil valloṟṟumām - piṉṉum _annilimoḻiyīṟṟuk kuṟṟiyalukarattiṉ muṉṉar niṉṟa melloṟṟāṉatu valloṟṟātalumām; _iṉi vaṉmiyoṟṟumēvi _ataṉ muṉ viḷitalum vēṇṭuvar - piṉṉum _annili moḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟuk kuṟṟiyalukarattiṉ muṉṉar _oruvalloṟṟu varappeṟalumāmeṉpar; _āvi vantāl pāviya muṟṟukarattiṉ citivum pakarntaṉarē-varumoḻi _uyirmutalākiya moḻi vantu puṇarntāl, nilimoḻiyīṟṟu muṟṟiyalukaramuṅ keṭum _eṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_22">Vi_22</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_22">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((lakaramey makara takaraṅkaḷōṭu puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. ṉakarameyyum ṇakarameyyum valliṉattōṭu puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. _uyirōṭu kūṭiya ḻakaram _uyir mutal moḻiyōṭu puṇartalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_īṟām lakāra matavan tetirntiṭil; _īṟṟeḻuttēl
<BR>_āṟāṅ kaṭivaṉmi yāmvaṉmi tōṉṟil; _ain tāmuṭalām
<BR>_āṟā muṭalval liṉamvariṉ; _āvimu ṉāviyoṭuṅ
<BR>kūṟā ḻakāra maḻintu ṭakāraṅ kuṟukiṭumē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _īṟām lakāram ma ta vantetirntiṭil-lakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal makāra takāraṅkaḷ vantu puṇarntāl, _anta lakāramāṉatu ṉakāramām; _īṟṟeḻuttēl _āṟām kaṭi vaṉmiyām vaṉmi tōṉṟil - ṉakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ṉakāramāṉatu _āṟām valliṉaveḻuttākiya ṟakāramām; _aintām _uṭalām _āṟām _uṭal valliṉam variṉ - ṇakaravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal valliṉam vantu puṇarntāl, _anta ṇakāramāṉatu ṭakāramām; _āvi muṉ _āviyoṭum kūṟā ḻakāram _aḻintu ṭakāraṅ kuṟukiṭumē - varumoḻi _uyirmutalākiya moḻivantu puṇar/ntāl, nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟil niṉṟa ḻakāramāṉatu taṉ muṉṉiṉṟa _uyirōṭum _aḻintu _aintām _uṭalākiya ṭakāramām (_e-ṟu).


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_23">Vi_23</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_23">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_oṉṟu mutal pattīṟākiya _eṇkaḷum, ..))
<BR>((.. nūṟu _eṉṉum _eṇṇum _aṭiyum vikāraṅkaḷ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_oṉṟuk koruvōr _iruvīr _iraṇṭukku mūṉṟumummū
<BR>_aṉṟuṟṟa nālukku nāṉkinti yāṟṟu _ēḻeḻuvām;
<BR>toṉṟuṟṟa _eṭṭukkeṇ ṇoṉpatoṉ pāṉoṭu toṇṭoḷḷum; pāṉ
<BR>paṉṟuṟṟa nūṟu patupaḵtu pattu; nū ṟāyiramē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _oṉṟukku _oru _or - _oṉṟeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _oru _eṉpatum _ōr _eṉpatum _ātēcamām; _iru _ir _iraṇṭukku-_iraṇṭeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _iru _eṉpatum _īreṉpatumātēcamām; mūṉṟu mu mū - mūṉṟeṉṉum _eṇṇukku mu _eṉpatum mū _eṉpatum _ātēcamām; _aṉṟuṟṟa nālukku nāṉku - nāleṉṉumeṇṇukku nāṉkeṉpatu _ātēcamām; _ainti - _ainteṉṉumeṇṇukku _aiyeṉpatātēcamām; _āṟu _aṟu = _āṟeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _aṟuveṉpatu _ātēcamām; _ēḻ _eḻuvām - _ēḻeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _eḻuveṉpatu _ātēcamām; toṉṟuṟṟa _eṭṭukku _eṇ - _eṭṭeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _eṇ _eṉpatu _ātēcamām; _oṉpatu _oṉpāṉoṭu toṇṭoḷḷum - _oṉpateṉṉum _eṇṇukku _oṉpāṉ _eṉpatum toṇ _eṉpatum toḷ _eṉpatum _ātēcamām; pāṉ paṉ tuṟṟa nūṟu patu paḵtu pattu - patteṉṉum _eṇṇukkuppāṉ _eṉpatum paṉ _eṉpatum nūṟeṉpatum patu _eṉpatum paḵtu _eṉpatum _ātēcamām; nūṟu _āyiramē - nūṟeṉṉum _eṇṇukku _āyiram _eṉpatu _ātēcamām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_24">Vi_24</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_24">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_uyirkkuṟṟeḻuttu ña na ma va _eṉpavaṟṟuṭaṉum ..))
<BR>((.. yakarattuṭaṉum puṇartalum, ..))
<BR>((.. ṭakaram ṇakaramātalum, ..))
<BR>((.. _orōviṭattu _oṟṟuttōṉṟutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. cila moḻikaḷiṉ _īṟṟu _ākāram ..))
<BR>((.. kuṟuki _ataṉōṭu _ukaram peṟutalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āvik kuṟiṟpiṉ ñanamavat tōṉṟilav voṟṟiṭiyām;
<BR>mēviya paṉṉoṉṟu tōṉṟillav vām; meyyil _aintirumūṉ
<BR>ṟāvatu muṇ(ṭu);_oṟ ṟorōvaḻit tōṉṟiṭum; _āvumavvāyt
<BR>tāviya vintā muyirpiṉ peṟuvaṉa tāmumuṇṭē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _āvi kuṟil piṉ ña na ma va tōṉṟil _avvoṟṟiṭiyām - _uyirkkuṟṟeḻuttiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal ña na ma vakkaḷ vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē _avvavvanta _oṟṟu mikku muṭiyum; mēviya paṉṉoṉṟu tōṉṟil va _ām - piṉṉum _avvuyirkkuṟṟeḻuttiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal yakāram vantu puṇarntāl, _iṭiyē vakaravoṟṟu vantu _ākamamām. meyyil _aintu _iru mūṉṟu _āvatum _uṇṭu - _orōviṭattu meykaḷukkuḷ ṭakāramāṉatu ṇakāramātalumām; _oṟṟu _orōvaḻi tōṉṟiṭum - _orōviṭattu _oṟṟu vantu tōṉṟutalumuṇṭu; _āvum _a _āyt tāviya _aintām _uyir piṉ peṟuvaṉatāmumuṇṭē - _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟil niṉṟa _ākāramāṉatu _akaramākak kuṟuki _akkuṟukaluṭaṉē _aintām _uyir peṟutalum _uṇṭu (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_25">Vi_25</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_25">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((cila nilimoḻi _īṟṟoṟṟum _īṟṟayal _akaramum _uyirātal ..))
<BR>((.. _uyirmeyyātal variṉ _aṭiyum vikāramum, ..))
<BR>((.. cilaviṭattu varumoḻi mutaluyir keṭutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. nilimoḻi _īṟṟuyir keṭutalum, ..))
<BR>((.. la ṉa ḷa ṇa ma ṉakkaḷ _oṉṟukkoṉṟāy varutalum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>niṉṟacol līṟṟumeym muṉṉā mutaluyir nīṇṭumeyyum
<BR>poṉṟu muyiro ṭuyirmeyvan tāl; vanta _āviyumpōyk
<BR>kuṉṟu morōvaḻi; kūṟiya _āvi yorōvaḻippōm;
<BR>_aṉṟi laṉaḷa ṇamaṉakka ḷoṉṟukkoṉ ṟāvaṉavē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> niṉṟa col _īṟṟumey muṉṉā mutaluyir nīṇṭu meyyum poṉṟum _uyiroṭu _uyirmey vantāl - varumoḻikku mutalāka _uyirātal _uyirmeyyātal vantu puṇarntāl, nilimoḻiyīṟṟayalil niṉṟa _akāramāṉatu _ākāramāka nīṇṭu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟuṅkeṭum; vanta _āviyum pōy kuṉṟum _orōvaḻi - _orōviṭattu varumoḻi mutal _uyir keṭutalumuṇṭu; kūṟiya _āvi _orō vaḻi pōm - _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟayaluyir keṭutalumuṇṭu; _aṉṟi la ṉa ḷa ṇa ma ṉakkaḷ _oṉṟukkoṉṟu _āvaṉavē - _iviyallāmalum lakārattukku ṉakāramum ḷakārattukku ṇakāramum makārattukku ṉakāramum _oṉṟukkoṉṟu _ātēcamām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_26">Vi_26</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_26">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((cuṭṭuppeyar _aṭiyum vēṟupāṭukaḷ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>kūṟiya cuṭṭiṉpiṉ ṉāytamuṅ kūṭum; cuṭ ṭīṟṟukaram
<BR>māṟi yuyiriraṇ ṭāvatu mām; vanta cuṭṭorukāl
<BR>vīṟuṭi neṭṭeḻut tākum; _aḷapum virintuniṟkum;
<BR>nūṟuṭi veḷḷitaṭ ṭāmarik kōyi ṉuṭaṅkiṭiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> kūṟiya cuṭṭiṉ piṉ _āytamuṅ kūṭum - nilimoḻic cuṭṭeḻuttiṉ piṉṉar _āytamum varappeṟum; cuṭṭīṟṟu _ukaram māṟi _uyir _iraṇṭāvatumām - nilimoḻic cuṭṭiṉatu _īṟṟiṉ niṉṟa _ukaramāṉatu keṭṭu _iraṇṭām _uyir peṟutalum _uṇṭu; vanta cuṭṭu _orukāl vīṟuṭi neṭṭeḻuttākum - _orōviṭattu varumoḻic cuṭṭu nīḷutalum _uṇṭu; _aḷapum virintu niṟkum - _annīḷutaluṭaṉē _aḷapeṭuttalumuṇṭu (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`nūṟuṭi veḷḷitaṭ ṭāmarik kōyi ṉuṭaṅkiṭiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_27">Vi_27</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_27">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((peyar vēṟṟumiyēṟṟuc cāriyiyōṭu kūṭukiyil ..))
<BR>((.. _uḷavām vikāraṅkaḷ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>tuppār peyarvēṟ ṟumiyi ṉakattun tokiyiṉkaṇṇuñ
<BR>ceppār moḻimutaṟ piṉcāri yivariṟ ṟērntavaṟṟuḷ
<BR>_oppār moḻiyī ṟuyiroṭum pōmoru kāluṭalpōm;
<BR>tappā vuyirmey keṭumoru kāleṉpar tāḻkuḻalē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> peyar vēṟṟumi muṭikkum _iṭattum toki vēṟṟumi muṭikkum _iṭattum moḻimutaṟpiṉ cāriyic coṟkaḷ vantu puṇarntāl, _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟum _īṟṟayaluyiruṅ keṭutalum, _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟoṟṟuk keṭutalum, _orōviṭattu nilimoḻiyiṉatu _īṟṟuyirmey keṭutalum _uṇṭu _eṉṟu colluvar mēlākiya pulavar (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`tāḻkuḻalē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_28">Vi_28</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_28">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((ḷakara lakara meykaḷ takarattoṭu puṇartalum ..))
<BR>((.. _ippaṭalattiṉ puṟaṉaṭiyum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_eṇṇiraṇ ṭāmoṟṟup paṉmūṉṟu meyniṉ ṟivaṟṟiṉ piṉṉē
<BR>_aṇṇiya tavvariṉ taṭṭaṟa vām;_avi yāytamumām; 
<BR>paṇṇiya canti pakarā taṉavum; pakarntavaṟṟāṟ
<BR>kaṇṇi yurikka matiyāl vaṉacak kaṉaṅkuḻiyē!

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _eṇṇiraṇṭām _oṟṟu paṉmūṉṟu mey niṉṟu _ivaṟṟiṉ piṉṉē _aṇṇiya ta variṉ ta ṭa ṟa _ām - ḷakāra lakāravoṟṟīṟṟu nilimoḻip patattiṉ piṉṉar varumoḻi mutal takāram vantu puṇarntāl, vanta takāramāṉatu muṟiyē ṭakāra ṟakāraṅkaḷām; _avi _āytamumām - piṉṉumanta ḷakāra lakāraṅkaḷ _āytamātalumām; paṇṇiya canti pakarātaṉavum pakarntavaṟṟāl kaṇṇi _urikka matiyāl - _iccantikaḷuṭ collāta cantikaḷuḷaveṉiṉum, _iccoṉṉa cūttiraṅkaḷāṉaṭakki muṭikka (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`vaṉacak kaṉaṅkuḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.

<P><B>((cantippaṭalam muṟṟum.))</B>
<HR>

<H1>((_iraṇṭāvatu collatikāram))</H1>
<A NAME="_patalam_2"><H2>((1. vēṟṟumippaṭalam))</H2></A>
<P>{{U 2}}

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_29">Vi_29</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_29">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((vēṟṟumiyiṉ tokiyum, kārakattiṉ tokiyum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_eṭṭām _eḻuvāy mutaṟpeyar vēṟṟumi; _āṟuḷavām
<BR>kaṭṭār karuttā mutaṟkā rakam; _avi kaṭṭurippiṉ
<BR>_oṭṭār karuttā karumaṅ karaṇamoṇ kōḷiyoṭum
<BR>ciṭṭā ravatiyo ṭātāram _eṉṟaṟi tēmoḻiyē!


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumi mutalākap peyar vēṟṟumi _eṭṭuḷavām; _avitām _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumiyum, _iraṇṭām vēṟṟumiyum, mūṉṟām vēṟṟumiyum, nāṉkām vēṟṟumiyum, _aintām vēṟṟumiyum, _āṟām vēṟṟumiyum, _ēḻām vēṟṟumiyum, viḷi vēṟṟumiyum _eṉakkoḷka; karuttā mutaṟ kārakam _āṟuḷavām; _avi collum pakkattuk karuttāk kārakam, karumak kārakam, kāraṇak kārakam, kōḷik kārakam, _avatik kārakam, _ātārak kārakam _eṉa _āṟu vakippaṭum (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`tēmoḻiyē!' _eṉpatu makaṭū_u muṉṉili.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_30">Vi_30</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_30">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((pālum ciṟappum cārntu peyarccoṟkaḷ ..))
<BR>((.. _ivvaḷaviṉavām _eṉpatum, mutal vēṟṟumiyiṉ _urupum))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_oruva ṉoruttiyoṉ ṟāñciṟap pōṭupal lōrpalavik
<BR>karutu muṟiyiṟ kalappaṉa vēṟṟumi kāṇmutalcu
<BR>maruvum_ar _ār_arkaḷ _ārkaḷ mārmutal vēṟṟumiyiṉ
<BR>_uruvam viḷivēṟ ṟumiyoḻit teṅku muṟappeṟumē.


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _oruvaṉik karutiṉa collum, _oruttiyik karutiṉa collum, palarik karutiṉa collum, _oṉṟik karutiṉa collum, palavik karutiṉa collum, _oruvaṉic ciṟappitta collum, _oruttiyic ciṟappitta collum, _oṉṟic ciṟappitta collum _eṉap peyarccollellām _eṭṭu vakippaṭṭa pirakirutiyām; _avaṟṟuḷ cuvvum _arrum _ārum _arkaḷum _ārkaḷum kaḷḷum mārum _eṉa _iviyēḻum mutal vēṟṟumik kurupukaḷām; _ivi _eṭṭām vēṟṟumiyoḻittoḻinta vēṟṟumi _āṟiṉ muṉpu niṟkavum peṟum _orōviṭattu (_e-ṟu.)

<P>`_eṅkum' _eṉṟa _ummiyāṉ, viḷivēṟṟumikku muṉṉum ciṟupāṉmi varappeṟum.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_31">Vi_31</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_31">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_eṇvakip peyarum, _eṭṭu vēṟṟumiyuṅ kūṭik ..))
<BR>((.. kāraka pataṅkaḷ _aṟupattu nāṉkām _eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_oruva ṉorutti palaroṉ ṟoṭupala vuñciṟappiṉ
<BR>_urupukaṇmūṉṟumuṭaṉvittup piṉṉeṭṭu vēṟṟumiyum
<BR>maruva niṟuvi yuṟaḻtara vāṅkā rakapataṅkaḷ
<BR>_uruvu maliyu maṟupattu nāṉkuḷa _oṇṭoṭiyē!


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> muṉ collappaṭṭa _eṭṭup pirakirutiyi muṟiyāṉē niṟutti, _aviyiṟṟiṉ piṉṉāka _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumi mutalākiya _eṭṭu vēṟṟumiyiyum _aṭivē vittuṟaḻa _avi _aṟupattu nāṉku kāraka patamām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>varalāṟu:- cāttaṉ, koṟṟaṉ - _oruvaṉik karutiṉa col.
cātti, koṟṟi - _oruttiyik karutiṉa col.
nāṭṭār, _ūrār - palarik karutiṉa col.
yāṉi, maram - _oṉṟik karutiṉa col.
yāṉikaḷ, maraṅkaḷ - palavik karutiṉa col.
_ivi kaḷḷeṉṉum pirattiyam _aḻintu yāṉipala, marampala _eṉavumvarum.
cāttaṉār, koṟṟaṉār - _oruvaṉic ciṟappitta col.
_irāmar, kaṇṇar _eṉa _ar _eṉṉum pirattiyamīṟāy varavum peṟum.
cāttiyār, koṟṟiyār - _oruttiyic ciṟappitta col.
_ammikaḷ, _avvikaḷ _eṉak kaḷḷeṉṉum pirattiyamīṟāy varavumpeṟum.
nariyaṉār, nāriyār - _oṉṟic ciṟappitta col.
_iccolleṭṭum vēṟṟumi _eṭṭiṉuṅ kūṭik kāraka pataṅkaḷ _aṟupattunālāmāṟu kāṇka.

<P><B>varalāṟu:-</B>
 cāttaṉ, cāttaṉi, cāttaṉāl, cāttaṉukku, cāttaṉpakkaliṉiṉṟu,cāttaṉuṭiya, cāttaṉpakkal, cāttaṉē _eṉavum;
koṟṟi, koṟṟiyi, koṟṟiyāl, koṟṟikku, koṟṟi pakkaliṉiṉṟu,koṟṟiyuṭiya, koṟṟipakkal, koṟṟī _eṉavum;
nāṭṭār, nāṭṭāri, nāṭṭārāl, nāṭṭārukku, nāṭṭār pakkaliṉiṉṟu,nāṭṭāruṭiya, nāṭṭārpakkal, nāṭṭīr _eṉavum;
yāṉi, yāṉiyi, yāṉiyāl, yāṉikku, yāṉipakkaliṉiṉṟu, yāṉiyuṭiya, yāṉipakkal, yāṉāy _eṉavum;
maraṅkaḷ, maraṅkaḷi, maraṅkaḷāl, maraṅkaḷukku, maraṅkaḷpakkaliṉiṉṟu, maraṅkaḷuṭiya, maraṅkaḷpakkal, maraṅkāḷ _eṉavum;
cāttaṉār, cāttaṉāri, cāttaṉārāl, cāttaṉārukku, cāttaṉārpakkaliṉiṉṟu, koṟṟiyāruṭiya, koṟṟiyārpakkal, koṟṟiyārē _eṉavum;
yāṉiyār, yāṉiyāri, yāṉiyārāl, yāṉiyārkku, yāṉiyārpakkaliṉiṉṟu, yāṉiyāruṭiya, yāṉiyār pakkal, yāṉiyārē _eṉavum varum.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_32">Vi_32</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_32">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((vaṭamoḻiyiṟ kāraka pataṅkaḷ _ivvaḷaviṉavām _eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_ātiyi lāṇpe ṇaliyeṉṟu nāṭṭi yatiṉarukē
<BR>_ōtiya vēṟṟumi yēḻiyuñ cērvit toruṅkataṉpiṉ
<BR>vātiya loṉṟo ṭiraṇṭu palaveṉa vittuṟaḻat
<BR>tītiya lāta vaṟupattu mūṉṟuṟun tērntaṟiyē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> vaṭamoḻik kāraka patam varumāṟu:- _āṇ peṇ _ali _eṉṟu vittu, _aviyiṟṟiṉ piṉ _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumi mutalāka _ēḻām vēṟṟumi _iṟutiyāka _ēḻu vēṟṟumiyum cērttu _ēka vacaṉam tuvi vacaṉam paku vacaṉameṉṉum mūṉṟu vacaṉattiyum kūṭṭiyuṟaḻa _aṟupattu mūṉṟu kāraka patamām; piṉṉiyum, _uyiriṟutiyum _oṟṟiṟutiyumākak kūṟuvārkku nūṟṟirupattāṟām; _aviyellām vaṭamoḻiyiṟ kaṇṭukoḷka.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_33">Vi_33</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_33">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((mutalvēṟṟumi mutaliya vēṟṟumiyurupukaḷ))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>kūṟiya coṟpiṉ poruṇmāt tirattiṟ kulaveḻuvāy
<BR>vīṟuṭi vēṟṟumi yeytu moruva ṉoruttiyoṉṟiṉ
<BR>_ēṟiya cuppala viṟcuvvuṅ kaḷḷumeṅ kummaḻiyum
<BR>_ūṟiya cucciṟap puppala riṟkaḷ ḷoḻintaṉavē.


<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> muṉ coṉṉa _eṭṭup pirakirutikkum piṉṉākac colliṉ poruṇ māttiratti viḷakkutaṟ poruṭṭākac cu _ar _ār _arkaḷ _ārkaḷ kaḷ mār _eṉṟu collappaṭṭa _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumip pirattiyamēḻum varum; varumiṭattu _oruvaṉik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉṉum _oruttiyik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉṉum _oṉṟik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉṉum cu _eṉṉum pirattiyamoṉṟē varum; palavik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpu cu kaḷ _eṉṉum pirattiyamiraṇṭum varum; _ellā _iṭattum cu _eṉṉum pirattiyamaḻintē varum.
_ellāviṭattum _aḻiyumāyiṉ varutaṟkuk kāraṇameṉṉeṉiṉ,vaṭamoḻiyuṭiyāṉ vāriyeṉṉuñ colli vittu mutalvēṟṟumi_ēkavacaṉattip poruḷ viḷakkutaṟporuṭṭu _evvaṇṇam _iṭṭaḻittāṉ,_ivaṉum _atupōla _ākki _aḻittālallātu patamākāteṉṟu _iṭṭaḻittāṉ_eṉka. _oruvaṉic ciṟappitta colliṉ piṉpum _oruttiyic ciṟappittacolliṉ piṉpum _oṉṟic ciṟappitta colliṉ piṉpum _ar _ār _arkaḷ_ārkaḷ kaḷ mār _eṉṉum _āṟu pirattiyamum varum. _ivi_ellāviṭattumāvaṉavalla. palarik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpu _āṟupirattiyamumām (_e-ṟu.)

<P>cāttaṉ-koṟṟaṉ _eṉa _oruvaṉik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpum,cātti-koṟṟi _eṉa _oruttiyik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpum,yāṉi-kutiri _eṉa _oṉṟik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpum, yāṉi -kutiri _eṉa _oṉṟik karutiṉa colliṉ piṉpum, cu-_eṉṉum _eḻuvāyvēṟṟumip pirattiyam niṟuttuka. niṟuttavē, colliṉporuṇmāttiratti viḷakkiṟṟām. collāvatu, cāttaṉeṉṟuccarikkappaṭāniṉṟa col. _ataṉ poruḷāvatu,karacaraṇātiyavayavaṅkaḷi _uṭiyatoru piṇṭamāy `cāttaṉāvāṉ_evaṉ?' _eṉṟu viṉāviṉārkku `_ivaṉ' _eṉa niṉṉāṟcollappaṭukiṉṟāṉyāvaṉ, _avaṉ _eṉak koḷka. `_eṅkumaḻiyumēṟiya cu' _eṉpataṉāl,_accoṟkaḷiṉ piṉpu niṉṟa cuvvi _ulōpittuc cāttaṉ, koṟṟaṉeṉṟu_uccarittuk koḷka.

<P>`palaviṟ cuvvum kaḷḷum' _eṉpataṉāl cuvveṉṉum pirattiyattikkoṭuttu maram niṉṟa _eṉavum, kaḷḷeṉṉum pirattiyattik koṭuttumaraṅkaḷ niṉṟa _eṉavumuṭikka `ciṟappup palariṟ kaḷḷoḻintaṉa'_eṉpataṉāl, pirakirutikaḷiṉ piṉpu _ar _ār _arkaḷ _ārkaḷ kaḷ mār_eṉṉum _āṟu pirattiyaṅkaḷuṅkoṭuttup paṉmiyākki, _ivarkaḷ cilar vēḷāḷar, _ivarkaḷ cilar pārppaṉarkaḷ, _ivarkaḷ cilar kuṟattikaḷ, _ivarkaḷ cilar nampimārkaḷ _eṉa muṭikka. kaḷ _eṉṉum pirattiyam mār _eṉṉum pirattiyattiṉ muṉṉum piṉṉum varappeṟum _ivi _ellām vēṇṭumiṭattu _iṟuti citittu muṭittukkoḷka.

<P>`kulaveḻuvāy' _eṉṟu ciṟappittavataṉāl, _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumip pirattiyaṅkaḷiṟ cuvveṉṉum pirattiyam _oḻittu _oḻinta _āṟu pirattiyamum, _iraṇṭām vēṟṟumi mutal _ēḻām vēṟṟumi _īṟāka _āṟu vēṟṟumip pirattiyaṅkaḷiṉ muṉpum tokiyiṉkaṇṇum _orōvaḻi vantu niṟkavum peṟumeṉka. viḻumiyāṉ viḻumiyāḷ viḻumiyōr _eṉṟākalumuṇṭu.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_34">Vi_34</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_34">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_ituvum _atu.))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_aiyeṉ patukaru mattiraṇ ṭāva tatuvorukāṟ
<BR>piya vaḻitarum mūṉṟōṭo ṭālām pakarkaruttā
<BR>viya nikaḻkara ṇattiṉ varum; kup poruṭṭeṉpatu
<BR>meytikaḻ vēṟṟumi nāṉkāva tāmikka kōḷiyilē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _ai _eṉpatu _iraṇṭām vēṟṟumip pirattiyam; _atu karumattiṉ kārakamām; _aḵtu _orōvaḻi _aḻintu niṟṟalumuṇṭu; _aḻintālum, _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumiyiṟ cuvvēpōlat taṉ vēṟṟumip poruḷi viḷakkum. mūṉṟām vēṟṟumikku _oṭu _ōṭu _āl _eṉa mūṉṟu pirattiyamuḷa; _avi karuttāviṉuṅ karaṇattiṉum varum; nāṉkām vēṟṟumikkuk ku poruṭṭu _eṉṉumiraṇṭu pirattiyamuḷa; _avi kōḷiyeṉṉuṅ kārakattiṉ varum (_e-ṟu.)

<P>varalāṟu:- cāttaṉi _aḻittāṉ, koṟṟiyik koṭuttāṉ, kaṭali nīntiṉāṉ _eṉpaṉa _iraṇṭām vēṟṟumiyiṟ karumak kārakamām.

<P>`_atu _orukāṟ piya vaḻitarum' _eṉpataṉāl, cōṟuṇṭāṉ - nīr kuṭittāṉ _eṉa vēṟṟumip pirattiyamaḻintum varum.

<P>`mutal vēṟṟumiyiṉuruvam viḷivēṟṟumi yoḻitteṅku muṟappeṟumē'. _eṉpataṉāl, vēḷāḷari, nāṭṭāri, vēḷāḷarkaḷi, nāṭṭārkaḷi, tavacikaḷi, nampimāri _eṉpuḻi _iraṇṭām vēṟṟumiyiṉ muṉpu _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumiyiṉurupukaḷ vantavāṟu kāṇka.

<P>`mūṉṟu _oṭu _ōṭu _ālām pakar karuttā viyanikaḻ karaṇattiṉvarum' _eṉpataṉāl, taccaṉāleṭukkappaṭṭatu vīṭu,taṭṭāṉāṟceyyappaṭṭatu tāli _eṉavum, vāycciyāṟ cetukkappaṭṭatumaram, _eḻuttāṇiyāleḻutappaṭṭatu _ēṭu _eṉavum varuvaṉa muṟiyēmūṉṟām vēṟṟumiyil karuttāk kārakamum karaṇak kārakamumām.

<P>cāttaṉoṭu _uṇṭāṉ, cāttaṉōṭu _uṇṭāṉ, _ūrōṭu kalantāṉ_eṉpavaṟṟil _oṭu, _ōṭu _eṉṉum pirattiyaṅkaḷ mūṉṟām vēṟṟumiyiṟkiriyā patattōṭuṅ kūṭi muṭintavāṟu kaṇṭukoḷka.

<P>tolkāppiyaṉār, _oṭu _eṉṉum pirattiyamoṉṟē mūṉṟām vēṟṟumikku_urupākac coṉṉār. `_ālum _āṉum mūṉṟaṉurupē' _eṉṟār _avinayaṉār.

<P>"calattāṟ poruḷceytē mārttal pacumaṭ
<BR>kalattuṇīr peytirī_i yaṟṟu".
<BR>_eṉpuḻi _āleṉṉu mūṉṟām vēṟṟumi _urupu vantavāṟu kāṇka.

<P>"vāram pularnta maṉattār maṇikkuṟaṅkiṉ
<BR>_īram pularntālu mēkāriv-vīrar
<BR>_akilōṭu kāvirinī rāṭi varuvār
<BR>tukilōṭu cuṟṟic cuḻaṉṟu".
<BR>_eṉavum,

<P>"poṉṉāra mārpiṟ puṉikaḻaṟkāṟ kiḷḷipēr
<BR>_uṉṉēṉeṉ ṟūḻulakki paṟṟiṉēṟ-kaṉṉō
<BR>maṉaṉōṭu vāyellā malkunīrk kōḻip
<BR>puṉaṉāṭaṉ pērē varum".
<BR>_eṉavum,

<P>"cuḻiyō ṭeṟipuṉaṟ poṉṉinaṉ ṉāṭaṉ curarkuruviṉ
<BR>vaḻiyō ṉamalaṉ mayiliyaṉ ṉīrmaṇi vāyiṉiṉṟum
<BR>moḻiyō terintila koṅkiyuñ ceyya mukattiraṇṭu
<BR>viḻiyō paṭukoli yōvilaṅ kōvantu niṉṟatuvē".
<BR>_eṉavum _iviyiṟṟil _oṭu _eṉṉum mūṉṟām vēṟṟumip pirattiyamvantavāṟu kāṇka.

<P>"nōyo ṭuṟaveṉṉi kollō nuṉiyeḵkiṉ
<BR>vāyiṭi māḷā tavarkku".
<BR>"vēloṭu niṉṟā ṉiṭuveṉ ṟatupōluṅ
<BR>kōloṭu niṉṟā ṉiravu".
<BR>_eṉa _oṭu _eṉṉum pirattiyam vantavāṟu kaṇṭukoḷka.

<P>`mutal vēṟṟumiyiṉ _uruvam viḷivēṟṟumi yoḻitteṅkumuṟappeṟumē' _eṉpataṉāl, vēḷāḷarāṟceyyappaṭṭatu,tavacikaḷāṟceyyappaṭṭatu, nampimārāṟceyyappaṭṭatu _eṉa mūṉṟāmvēṟṟumiyiṉ muṉṉē _eḻuvāy vēṟṟumi vantavāṟu kaṇṭukoḷka.

<P>`kupporuṭ ṭeṉpatu meytikaḻ vēṟṟumi nāṉkāvatāmikka kōḷiyilē' _eṉpataṉāl, _irappāṉukkuc cōṟiṭṭāṉ, _ēṟpāṉukkup poṉṉīntāṉ, nallāṉukku mantiraṅ koṭuttāṉ, teyvattukkup pūviṭṭāṉ _eṉa nāṉkām vēṟṟumiyiṟ kōḷikkārakam vantavāṟu kāṇka. `mutal vēṟṟumiyiṉ _uruvam viḷivēṟṟumi yoḻitteṅku muṟappeṟumē' _eṉpataṉāl, nāṭṭārkku _iṭṭāṉ, vēḷāḷarkaḷukku _aḷittāṉ, tavacikaḷukkuk koṭuttāṉ, nampimārkaḷukku _īntāṉ _eṉa nāṉkām vēṟṟumiyiṉ muṉ _eḻuvāyurupu vantavāṟu kāṇka. karumpu, cōṟu _eṉa niṟuttip poruṭṭu _eṉa nāṉkām vēṟṟumiyurupu varuvittu, _iṉ_eṉṉuñ cāriyiccol _iṭippaṭuttuc canti kāriyam paṇṇi, karumpiṉporuṭṭu vēliyiṭṭāṉ, cōṟṟiṉ poruṭṭu _ūr cēvittāṉ _eṉa muṭittup poruṭṭurupu vantavāṟu kāṇka.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_Vi_35">Vi_35</A>
<A Target="Left" HREF="VC_trsl.htm#_Vi_trsl_35">[T.V.Gangadharan's transl.]</A>
<BR>((_ituvum _atu.))</H3>

<P>{{C PUTTA}}
<P>_āṉāḷā rārka ḷatuviṉa vāṟiṟ kuṭippiṉkuvvēl
<BR>nūṉā ṭiyapata mānuva lātāra mēḻiṉiṟkē
<BR>tāṉā muḻivayiṉ pakka luḻiyilkaṇ cārpiṟavum
<BR>vāṉā maliniṉṟa vaṟṟil varū_umin tavatiyilē.

<P>{{C PERUN}}
<P><B>(_i-ḷ)</B> _oṉṟiṉit tuṭakkik koṭu niṟṟalē taṉakkup poruḷākavuṭiya _āṟām vēṟṟumikku _āṉ _āḷ _ār _ārkaḷ _atu _iṉa _eṉṉuñ coṟkaḷiṉ muṉ _uṭi _eṉṉum _āṟām vēṟṟumi peṟṟu, _uṭiyāṉ-_uṭiyāḷ-_uṭiyār-_uṭiyārkaḷ-_uṭiyatu-_uṭiyiṉaveṉṉum _āṟu pirattiyamum muṉ collappaṭṭa _eṭṭup pirakirutikaḷiṉ piṉpu marapu piḻiyāmal varum; _uṭiyeṉṉum vēṟṟumiyiṉ piṉpu _akāram _ākamamāy _uṭiyaveṉṟum varum; _inta _ēḻu coṟkaḷiṉ muṉṉiṉṟa _āṟām vēṟṟumitāṉ kāraka patamākātē _oṉṟit tuṭakkik koṭu niṟkumiṭattu varappeṟum; _āṟām vēṟṟumi kāraka patamākum poḻutu ku _eṉṉum pirattiyamoṉṟē varum; _ātārameṉṟu collappaṭṭa poruḷiṉmēl varum _ēḻām vēṟṟumikku, kē _uḻi vayiṉ pakkal _uḻi _il kaṇ _eṉṉumēḻu pirattiyamum _uriya. `cār piṟavum' _eṉpataṉāl, _iṭam _iṭi muṉ piṉ kīḻ mēl _uḷ puṟam vāy mutaliyavum _uriya; `vāṉ nāmali' _eṉpataṉporuḷ, vāliyatāy nāviṉkaṇ maliyāniṉṟa _eṉpatu. _avati _eṉṟu collappaṭṭa poruḷiṉ _aintām vēṟṟumip pirattiyamāṉatu, _ēḻām vēṟṟumip pirattiyaṅkaḷiṉaṉpiṉ `niṉṟu' _eṉṉuñ coṟpeṟṟu varum (_e-ṟu.)

<P>varalāṟu:- _ivaṉ koṟṟaṉuṭiyāṉ.
